            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 7716,
            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"# Rollout order\\n\\nRollout note 1: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 2: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 3: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 4: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 5: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 6: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 7: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 8: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 9: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 10: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 11: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 12: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 13: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 14: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 15: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 16: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 17: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 18: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 19: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 20: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 21: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 22: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 23: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 24: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 25: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 26: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 27: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 28: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 29: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 30: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 31: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 32: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 33: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 34: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 35: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\nRollout note 36: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\\n\\n:::ask{#rollout-order urgency=\\\"med\\\" multiple=\\\"false\\\" state=\\\"open\\\"}\\nWhich service moves first?\\n\\n- Ledger first\\n- Mirror first\\n:::\\n\",\"markdown_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"heading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rollout order\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rollout note 1: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rollout note 2: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rollout note 3: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rollout note 4: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Rollout note 5: the ledger and the mirror each keep a clock of their own.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\"